<title>USA: Bell Atlantic Corp Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Bell Atlantic Corp Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.17		    $1.38</p>
<p> Net			515,600		  606,000</p>
<p> Operating revs     3,413,900		3,219,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 439,900		  440,200</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: For quarters ended March 31</p>
<p>Without a $0.32 per share benefit for an accounting change in the 1996 quarter, per share earnings would have been $1.06.</p>
<p>Operating revenues exclude benefits from accounting changes, income from unconsolidated businesses and other income.</p>
</text>
